A lazy line after a comment keeps the deepest list open

```
- a
  - b
{% c
 d %}
 tail

  - z
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li><p>b

tail</p></li>
      <li><p>z</p></li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  - mid
    - b
 {% c
   d %}
  tail

    - z
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>mid
        <ul>
          <li><p>b

tail</p></li>
          <li><p>z</p></li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```
